ex:ActOfAcquisition rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfAcquisition rdfs:comment "Local extension (D9). Rejected cco:ont00000950 'Act of Maintenance' (modifying Material Artifacts) and cco:ont00000402 'Act of Communication' (mere ICE transfer). Securing/obtaining a held entity anchors at the generic Planned Act. Expected to recur in procurement/asset-acquisition categories (4.0, 10.0)." .
ex:ActOfAcquisition rdfs:label "Act of Acquisition" .
ex:ActOfAcquisition rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfAcquisition skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent obtains from some authority or supplier an entity (such as an authorization, license, or resource) that the Agent did not previously hold." .

ex:ActOfDevelopment rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfDevelopment rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because development spans both informational and material outputs (new technologies, software/hardware components, prototypes, delivery processes) and is broader than cco:ont00001359 (Act of Manufacturing, mass production) and cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction, building to contract); a development act whose product is specifically a built/mass-produced material artifact should instead use those narrower CCO acts, attaching the material product via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), not has output (reserved for ICEs). Recurs across develop/build categories (2.0, 4.0, 8.0)." .
ex:ActOfDevelopment rdfs:label "Act of Development" .
ex:ActOfDevelopment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfDevelopment skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent brings a novel product, service, solution, technology, component, prototype, or process from a specification or concept into an existent realized state." .

ex:ActOfImprovement rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfImprovement rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Anchored under cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): it alters an existing occurrent-type or system rather than merely processing information or composing a new plan. Distinct from ex:ActOfImplementation (enacts a fixed directive). Rejected cco:ont00000950 'Act of Maintenance' (restores/preserves a Material Artifact's designed Qualities/Functions, whereas improvement raises performance of a process/system). Recurs in improve/reengineer/enhance/sustain processes (13.0)." .
ex:ActOfImprovement rdfs:label "Act of Improvement" .
ex:ActOfImprovement rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfImprovement skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent modifies an existing process, system, or capability with the intent of raising its performance, quality, or fitness against stated objectives." .

ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). CCO 2.0 has no Act-of-Establishment/Organization class (verified: no 'Act of Establish/Organiz/Constitut/Found' label in the closure). REJECTED ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): formulating composes a Directive ICE, but establishing a committee primarily constitutes an independent continuant (the body) rather than authoring a directive; the responsibility-assignment directive is a downstream byproduct of seating the body, not the act's primary product. Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). Recurs in 9.0." .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdfs:label "Act of Organizational Establishment" .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent constitutes and seats an Organization or organizational body (such as a board, committee, or unit), bringing the body into existence and conferring its mandate." .

ex:ActOfRemuneration rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Inlines the verified CCO leaf cco:ont00000449 (Act of Remuneration, subClassOf cco:ont00001334 Act of Purchasing subClassOf cco:ont00000836) for payroll rows whose APQC text is salary/compensation disbursement to employees -- a closer genus than ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction. NOT used for payroll-TAX remittance to a government authority. cco:ont00000228 co-asserted because 449 is outside the standalone-SHACL S2 process-anchor allowlist." .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:label "Act of Remuneration" .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000449 .
ex:ActOfRemuneration skos:definition "An Act of Remuneration in which an Employer disburses a Financial Instrument (salary, wages, bonus, or other compensation) to an Employee for services performed." .

ex:ActOfReporting rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). CCO 2.0 has no broad reporting class spanning compilation and assertion. Anchored under cco:ont00000379 (Act of Representative Communication), with cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) co-anchored so standalone SHACL resolves the act chain: reporting transfers to recipients a descriptive account (report, statement, scorecard, filing) asserting an organization's condition or results. Pure submission of an already-prepared report may use the verified leaf cco:ont00000151 directly." .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:label "Act of Reporting" .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000379 .
ex:ActOfReporting skos:definition "An Act of Representative Communication in which an Agent transfers to one or more recipients a Descriptive Information Content Entity (such as a report, statement, scorecard, or filing) that asserts, as true, a representation of an organization's condition or results." .
